{"id":42789,"bangumiId":42789,"type":2,"name":"GUNDAM EVOLVE","name_cn":"高达 EVOLVE","date":"2001-05-17","year":"2001","region":"jp","platform":"OVA","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/92/2d/42789_1118O.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/92/2d/42789_1118O.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/92/2d/42789_1118O.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/92/2d/42789_1118O.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/92/2d/42789_1118O.jpg"},"summary":"GUNDAM EVOLVE是Sunrise与BANDAI在2001年至2003年间所制作的实验性3DCG动画短片，为高达系列作品当中第一部全电脑制作的映像作品。第一期至2003年为止共五话，于2005年8月决定追加制作至第15话，目前DVD已发售完毕。\r\n　　GUNDAM EVOLVE本来是随着BANDAI特定的数种PG版高达模型当中附赠的映像作品，以实验各种2D与3D的动画技术与表现技法为主要目的。各出场机体的CG原始模型来自于BANDAI的高达模型设计图，并加上动画演出所需要的修饰。在剧情方面则大多是原作没有出现的小外传，Evo2与Evo3还带有一些搞笑的成分。但是随着本系列在爱好者中打出知名度，在Evo4的GP03剧中不仅出现了新设定，在Evo5还请富野由悠季为新的if故事亲自编剧。而且也从模型附赠品转换为实际发售的OVA。","rating":{"rank":5409,"total":255,"count":{"1":0,"2":0,"3":2,"4":10,"5":36,"6":93,"7":82,"8":22,"9":3,"10":7},"score":6.4},"collection":{"on_hold":25,"dropped":24,"wish":203,"collect":427,"doing":32},"tags":[{"name":"高达","count":97,"total_count":42436},{"name":"OVA","count":91,"total_count":371698},{"name":"SUNRISE","count":86,"total_count":93640},{"name":"2001","count":46,"total_count":15960},{"name":"GUNDAM","count":45,"total_count":12127},{"name":"原创","count":31,"total_count":635483},{"name":"富野由悠季","count":30,"total_count":10908},{"name":"萝卜","count":28,"total_count":53167},{"name":"机战","count":22,"total_count":52136},{"name":"广告","count":20,"total_count":3528},{"name":"科幻","count":18,"total_count":260265},{"name":"钢普拉","count":11,"total_count":52},{"name":"機動戦士ガンダム","count":10,"total_count":744},{"name":"今西隆志","count":8,"total_count":845},{"name":"日本","count":8,"total_count":313392},{"name":"短片","count":8,"total_count":104070}],"eps":15,"total_episodes":15,"aliases":["高达 EVOLVE","GUNDAM EVOLVE","机动战士高达 进化","ガンダムEVOLVE"],"sourceType":"bibliography","nsfw":false}